  - "CHAPTER 2  \u2022  ELEVATION"
  - Your telekinesis beam is getting steadier. The tower top is one step away.
  - MATAHARI APARTMENTS // L2
  - Press [TAB] to switch to Flexible Mode so Telekinesis is active.
  - Aim at BEBAN-RAK on the upper-right platform, press [F] to pull it down to PAD-UTARA.
  - Aim at CORE-01 on the upper-left tower, press [F] to lower it, then bring it in through the open barrier.
  - CORE-01 is stuck on top of the west pole with no stairs!
  - In Flexible Mode [TAB], use the [F] Telekinesis beam to lower objects from high places.
