  - Success! Now you've mastered FUSION [2] to combine heavy loads.
  - FUSION WORKSHOP // 01
  - Law of Conservation of Space
  - Approach RINGAN-A or RINGAN-B (or hold one and bring it close to its pair until a green link line appears).
  - "Press [2] to run FUSION \u2014 both will merge into one 2.4 t block."
  - Bring the combined 2.4 t block to PAD-BERAT so the red barrier goes out, then place CORE-01 at ANCHOR-01.
  - The PAD-BERAT plate needs at least 2.2 t. In front of you are the RINGAN-A cube (1.2 t) and the RINGAN-B prism (1.2 t).
  - Bring one near its pair until the green curved line lights up, then press [2] FUSION to merge the different shapes.
